                    <p>
                        <b>(5)</b>&nbsp;<b style=" padding: 0 0 0 10px;">(a)</b>
                        Candidates called for interview and actually interviewed shall only be reimbursed to and fro fare by shortest route as per rules from the address of correspondence in India to the place of interview on submission of proof of journey (Ticket and Boarding Pass for Air travel and of Rail Ticket) as per rules subject to actuals whichever is lower, limited to the details as under.
                    </p>

