                    <p><b></b> Bus fare for road journey from / to a place not connected by Rail shall be admissible, subject to production of proof of journey.</p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px; ">
                    <p><b>(b)</b>  Further, in case an applicant is not allowed for interview due to ineligibility found during document verification process, reimbursement of travel fare shall not be admissible.  </p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px; ">
                    <p><b>(c)</b>  The reimbursement towards to and fro journey shall be entertained only if the candidate has actually been Interviewed. Please ensure that all documents detailed in Para (3) above, in requisite number of sets as mentioned therein, are submitted to ensure participation in the Interview.  </p>

                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td valign="top" style="border: 0; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; padding: 0 40px; ">
