                    <ol type="i">
                        <li>Para [12(vi)]. Since all the applications will be screened based on the data furnished in the online application and without any documentary evidence / proof, the candidate should ensure that they meet all the prescribed eligibility criteria and other conditions as mentioned in this advertisement. </li>
                        <li style="padding: 2px 0px 0px 0px ">Para [12(vii)]. Candidates should note that the details provided by them in their application form are taken on their face value and the onus of proving the correctness and authenticity of the same as and when required lies with the applicant.</li>
                        <li style="padding: 2px 0px 0px 0px ">You are therefore advised to, in your own interest to check, confirm and ensure that you meet the prescribed eligibility criteria for the post applied by you as detailed in the advertisement before presenting yourself for the interview. You must also ensure that all requisite documents and copies thereof as detailed above are made available for submission and verification prior to the interview. Please note that failure on either of these counts shall render you ineligible to attend the interview and no communication in this regard shall be entertained by the Company.</li>
                        <li style="padding: 2px 0px 0px 0px ">Your shortlisting for the interview is based on the facts / statements provided by you in your online application without any preliminary scrutiny of the same. If any of the said detail is found to be materially wrong or incorrect or misleading, your candidature shall be liable to be cancelled at any stage of the recruitment process or after selection notwithstanding your attending the interview.</li>
                    </ol>
                </td>
